  "linear_leaf_policy": "Same v34 input features and original Earth/CryoSleep spatial expert. Fixed run005 LGB15 parameters throughout; v55 is the matched scaled/categorical-schema constant-leaf control. v56 uses fresh inner3 OOF to select constant, linear_lambda1,10,100 in that frozen tie order by pooled correct count, then Logloss, then configuration index. StandardScaler, category vocabulary and spatial spline fit only the respective inner training rows; the spline may be shared across the four options only within that same split. Numerical NaNs stay NaN; unknown categories become missing. A fresh complete outer-training pipeline refits the chosen option for exactly700 rounds. No outer-label early stopping, threshold or blend search. 1200-second whole-stage deadline; incomplete search fails closed without candidate scores. Existing gate compares v6, so v44 stability checks remain necessary before online approval.",
